# starformation_and_feedback with R2's flags (SFprescription 1: sfr_br06 with radial integration, BulgeSizeOn 3), at substep 0; a stable disk after star formation, so the instability takes no gas branch.
# galaxy 0: R2 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R2/model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 c6af6c9385d41adcccbd5f19e064323486706b0965183f61ebded290331f6714), Snap_32 row 15 (GalaxyIndex 65, Type 0).
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time
# state (the writer stores these fields verbatim; DiskScaleRadius is the output's
# DiskRadius). Constructed: OutflowRate 0 (its value at substep 0 after the first-occupied
# reset, R/src/core_build_model.c:276) and zero histories, as at substep 0; the timing is
# the R0 templates' (c03's Age values). The stored H2gas and H1gas are overwritten by the call.
# Reachability: R2-reachable.
